{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的感受词与叙述交替较密，尤其S01、S06、S13，扫读时不如Y固定的左右分区轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然更密，但重点词的放大加亮、叙述与音乐感受的交替，以及感受词随音乐到时出现，让我更容易抓住人物每一阶段的心理变化，也能把具体音乐细节和内心活动联系起来。尤其从怀念、动摇、反复质疑到不再逼自己选边，X保留了更多细微的心理转折，前后呼应也更充分。Y的左右分区更容易扫读，叙述也更连贯，但部分感受和音乐细节被压缩，人物心理的层次与最终情绪的细腻程度有所损失。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aa08392d-d6ef-4704-8684-8274b57c34d7", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T204730730699Z", "elapsed_seconds": 81.015, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:48:51.765616+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "70ce1d726fe8960a18fcb64e6d91aae804d8e3137db2e03bd31657f24ca36c1f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme